# Accounting ERP feed: GET /api/erp/upload-log (Authorization: Bearer <ERP_API_KEY>).
# Rotate: generate a new random key (for example `openssl rand -hex 32`), set ERP_API_KEY in Vercel,
# redeploy, then give the ERP the new key. Unset = the endpoint answers 401 to everyone. Never commit the real value.
ERP_API_KEY=
